{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/963108-voting-for-kiths","id":963108,"title":"Voting for Kiths?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-03T22:33:15-07:00","id":963108,"title":"Voting for Kiths?","content":"Do you think there is a chance that players could vote for fan-made kiths to be introduced into the second edition source book? I really like 1d4chan's Berserker, Deionscribe's Fury, Wavemaster, and White Dragon Oak's Venator. I think it would be a lot of fun to see these kiths in the new edition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-04T06:05:27-07:00","id":963184,"title":"","content":"Huh. This is surprising to see.<br /> <br /> I'll admit, having some of my fan-made kiths end up in Changeling 2E sounds pretty ambitious. And it never even crossed my mind when I started putting together <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1elqCKhNJweqnLuUy8Rbh2PiZSsnccnXQWrNy8cPf5o4/edit\" target=\"_blank\">that list of mine</a>. Still, I agree that having at least some of those kiths end up there would be fun <i>and</i> cool to see.<br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-04T14:34:14-07:00","id":963388,"title":"","content":"It was done once in the past for a Bloodlines book for VtR 1e, though more of an open submission thing.<br /> <br /> It hasn't been done since (though Onyx Path has been avoiding the &quot;book of Z-splat&quot; thing).<br /> <br /> But who knows?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-04T14:41:20-07:00","id":963390,"title":"","content":"I would be delighted by such a thing, but I don't think it's likely, and I'm certain that it wouldn't be for the core even if they decided that they did want to do it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-04T15:48:32-07:00","id":963423,"title":"","content":"Perhaps if we get enough people to request it, the game writers might be willing to do it. Didn't they mention that they wanted feedback and suggestions for second edition?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-04T19:28:59-07:00","id":963486,"title":"","content":"Okay. So. I can't make any sort of official announcement that this is a thing I want to do at this juncture. But, I'm curious. I'm interested. I'd have to look at some logistics. <br /> <br /> I CAN'T fit new Kiths into the core book. I just can't. It's not realistic, and I'm scrambling to meet a big deadline as it is. <br /> <br /> But I might have room in future books. So there's some possibility. In fact, I think I have a good opportunity lined up for that. But I can't say for certain just yet. <br /> <br /> The biggest problem really is that if I were going to do this, I'd have to contract and pay writers. That isn't inherently a problem, per se. But it becomes an issue when you consider that Kiths are like a couple hundred words each (250 is actually my guideline for my writers). So I'd really rather work it out so a given writer gets at least 1,000 words' attention, so I'm not contracting for pocket change. I could see maybe showcasing five writers, each with like four Kiths, which would be like 5,000 words' space. That'd be 20 Kiths. I think that'd be pretty reasonable, if I can work up the logistics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-04T20:24:00-07:00","id":963503,"title":"","content":"Great! It would be fun to do a competition on the forums where players could vote for potential fan created kiths in future books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-04T23:02:07-07:00","id":963562,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/963108-voting-for-kiths?p=963486#post963486\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay. So. I can't make any sort of official announcement that this is a thing I want to do at this juncture. But, I'm curious. I'm interested. I'd have to look at some logistics.<br /> <br /> I CAN'T fit new Kiths into the core book. I just can't. It's not realistic, and I'm scrambling to meet a big deadline as it is.<br /> <br /> But I might have room in future books. So there's some possibility. In fact, I think I have a good opportunity lined up for that. But I can't say for certain just yet.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a start <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I'll keep my fingers crossed until then, all the while waiting for the core book's release. I am <i>really</i> eager to see the stuff on Entitlements, and any additional material to the Courts.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/963108-voting-for-kiths?p=963486#post963486\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The biggest problem really is that if I were going to do this, I'd have to contract and pay writers. That isn't inherently a problem, per se. But it becomes an issue when you consider that Kiths are like a couple hundred words each (250 is actually my guideline for my writers). So I'd really rather work it out so a given writer gets at least 1,000 words' attention, so I'm not contracting for pocket change. I could see maybe showcasing five writers, each with like four Kiths, which would be like 5,000 words' space. That'd be 20 Kiths. I think that'd be pretty reasonable, if I can work up the logistics.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, if you're ever curious enough to comb through the fan-made kiths that have popped up, I'd say it eases up your workload somewhat. But hey, that's my opinion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T08:26:19-07:00","id":964307,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/963108-voting-for-kiths?p=963486#post963486\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay. So. I can't make any sort of official announcement that this is a thing I want to do at this juncture. But, I'm curious. I'm interested. I'd have to look at some logistics.<br /> <br /> I CAN'T fit new Kiths into the core book. I just can't. It's not realistic, and I'm scrambling to meet a big deadline as it is.<br /> <br /> But I might have room in future books. So there's some possibility. In fact, I think I have a good opportunity lined up for that. But I can't say for certain just yet.<br /> <br /> The biggest problem really is that if I were going to do this, I'd have to contract and pay writers. That isn't inherently a problem, per se. But it becomes an issue when you consider that Kiths are like a couple hundred words each (250 is actually my guideline for my writers). So I'd really rather work it out so a given writer gets at least 1,000 words' attention, so I'm not contracting for pocket change. I could see maybe showcasing five writers, each with like four Kiths, which would be like 5,000 words' space. That'd be 20 Kiths. I think that'd be pretty reasonable, if I can work up the logistics.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can't begin to state how excited this has made me. An opportunity to make a few of our own kiths into official ones would be a dream come true. I was wondering, though, for the winners of such a contest, would they be added to Onyx Path's pool of potential freelancers at that point, or would they still need to send in submissions if they wished to work on other Onyx Path projects in the future?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T08:29:40-07:00","id":964311,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>White Oak Dragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/963108-voting-for-kiths?p=964307#post964307\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I can't begin to state how excited this has made me. An opportunity to make a few of our own kiths into official ones would be a dream come true. I was wondering, though, for the winners of such a contest, would they be added to Onyx Path's pool of potential freelancers at that point, or would they still need to send in submissions if they wished to work on other Onyx Path projects in the future?</div> </div> </div> </div>They'd still have to submit formally for other games most likely, although these WOULD be pretty much perfect submission sizes, and that's a nice foot in the door I guess? Although I'd add them to potential Changeling writers? And if there's a good, solid experience, I'd give a nod to the other devs in that regard. <br /> <br /> I guess the easier answer is, &quot;Our processes aren't quite that formal. But it sure as hell couldn't hurt your chances.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T10:06:30-07:00","id":964354,"title":"","content":"Awesome. Thanks for letting me know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}